@startsalt wireframe-nav
' Spec 001 — role-aware navigation at phone width (REQ-001-12).
' Four variants of the same header; the drawer opens from the ☰ button.
' Wireframe only — not a visual design.
' Updated 2026-11-12: Employer items are live (spec 003); Admin links to the admin area (spec 002).

{
  {T
    + Header (375 px) and open drawer, per role
  }
  {
    {+ <b>Visitor</b>
      { [≡] | <b>jairojobs</b> | [Log in] }
      --
      { ≡ drawer
        | Browse jobs
        | ..
        | <b>Sign up</b>
        | Log in
      }
    } |
    {+ <b>Candidate</b>
      { [≡] | <b>jairojobs</b> | (●) }
      --
      { ≡ drawer
        | Browse jobs
        | My applications   <i>(007)</i>
        | My profile        <i>(006)</i>
        | ..
        | Settings
        | Log out
      }
    }
  }
  {
    {+ <b>Employer</b>
      { [≡] | <b>jairojobs</b> | (●) }
      --
      { ≡ drawer
        | Browse jobs
        | My listings
        | <b>[ + Post a job ]</b>
        | ..
        | Settings
        | Log out
      }
    } |
    {+ <b>Admin</b>
      { [≡] | <b>jairojobs</b> | (●) }
      --
      { ≡ drawer
        | Browse jobs
        | <b>Admin</b> ▸
        | ..
        | Settings
        | Log out
      }
    }
  }
  {T
    + Notes
    ++ (●) = avatar / account indicator; tapping opens the drawer too
    ++ "Browse jobs" is always present (REQ-001-1)
    ++ Items marked (NNN) are placeholders until that spec ships
    ++ Admin has no candidate/employer items — one role per account
    ++ Admin opens the admin area: Regions (002), My listings and Post a job (003); more with 004 / 008
    ++ Desktop: same items inline in the header; drawer only below md
  }
}
@endsalt
